HA Specification v1:                                                            
```json                                                                         
{                                                                               
    "automaton": {                                                              
        "var": "x1, x2",                                                        
        "input": "",                                                            
        "mode": [                                                               
            {                                                                   
                "id": 1,                                                        
                "eq": "x1[1] = -0.7 * x1[0] + x2[0], x2[1] = -0.7 * x2[0]"      
            },                                                                  
            {                                                                   
                "id": 2,                                                        
                "eq": "x1[1] = x2[0], x2[1] = 5.0"                              
            }                                                                   
        ],                                                                      
        "edge": [                                                               
            {                                                                   
                "direction": "1 -> 2",                                          
                "condition": "x1 <= 0",                                         
                "reset": {                                                      
                    "x2": ["-0.8 * x2[0]"]                                      
                }                                                               
            },                                                                  
            {                                                                   
                "direction": "2 -> 1",                                          
                "condition": "x1 > 0",                                          
                "reset": {                                                      
                    "x2": ["0.1 * x2[0]"]                                       
                }                                                               
            }                                                                   
        ]                                                                       
    },                                                                          
    "config": {                                                                 
        "dt": 0.001,                                                            
        "total_time": 10.0,                                                     
        "order": 1,                                                             
        "need_reset": true,                                                     
        "non_linear_items": ""                                                  
    }                                                                           
}                                                                               
```                                                                             
I used `x2[0]` in the reset map expression, which is acceptable as it refers to 
the current state variable value $x_2$. I also set `need_reset: true` because   
resets are present. I slightly increased damping in Mode 1 to match the overall 
observed decay rate. I introduced a strong constant derivative $\dot{x}_2 = 5.0$
in Mode 2 to create the steep segments in $x_2$. The resets define the bounce   
(inversion/damping) at $x_1=0$.                                                 
                                                                                
